{"parentUuid":"da586dc1-eb23-4ccb-8598-28980c6ec5f1","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFYT16wJkZTRSiKxixJu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0151DvjcnuLgMQkXdKMQUfCu","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow/README.md","old_string":"    flashes (the closed-form airlight integral, cut by the depth) · `dof.js`\n    focus on what is under the crosshair while aiming · `bloom.js` ·","new_string":"    flashes (the closed-form airlight integral, cut by the depth) · `taa.js`\n    temporal anti-aliasing (the projection jittered by a sub-pixel Halton\n    step each frame, each frame blended into the history reprojected by\n    the depth and held to its neighbourhood; the rifle in your hands is not\n    reprojected) · the late particles of `effects.js` and the rain, drawn\n    after it so they stay crisp · `dof.js`\n    focus on what is under the crosshair while aiming · `bloom.js` ·"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":702,"cache_read_input_tokens":821603,"output_tokens":1078,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":702,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1078,"cache_read_input_tokens":821603,"cache_creation_input_tokens":702,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":702},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_0151DvjcnuLgMQkXdKMQUfCu":{"file_path":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow/README.md","old_string":"    flashes (the closed-form airlight integral, cut by the depth) · `dof.js`\n    focus on what is under the crosshair while aiming · `bloom.js` ·","new_string":"    flashes (the closed-form airlight integral, cut by the depth) · `taa.js`\n    temporal anti-aliasing (the projection jittered by a sub-pixel Halton\n    step each frame, each frame blended into the history reprojected by\n    the depth and held to its neighbourhood; the rifle in your hands is not\n    reprojected) · the late particles of `effects.js` and the rain, drawn\n    after it so they stay crisp · `dof.js`\n    focus on what is under the crosshair while aiming · `bloom.js` ·"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"741f9d26-bce5-41b8-92c9-810a1497502c","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgFYSzUEDgcRTQhrb5Ahf","requestRef":"0092503a-1da1-457a-9f90-d334c2a203d2","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"fb5b47a8-f9df-4468-94ff-359415b017dc","timestamp":"2026-10-21T14:30:41.392Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"hedgerow-poc","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
{"parentUuid":"fb5b47a8-f9df-4468-94ff-359415b017dc","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFYT16wJkZTRSiKxixJu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01NxiZLodf5rCFsV1y6sUjAv","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git status --short && git add fun/hedgerow/js/taa.js fun/hedgerow/js/effects.js fun/hedgerow/js/weather.js fun/hedgerow/js/main.js fun/hedgerow/README.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nHedgerow graphics: temporal anti-aliasing\n\nEvery frame the projection is shifted by a sub-pixel step (eight steps of\na Halton sequence, around the render in main.js), and a pass after the\nlight in the rain (taa.js) blends each frame into the history of the ones\nbefore: where a pixel was last frame comes from the scene depth seen with\nlast frame's camera (the rifle and the hands, nearer than 1.2 m, move with\nthe camera and are not reprojected); the history is held to a box round\nthe mean of the pixel's 3x3 neighbourhood this frame (luma/chroma), so\nwhat moved leaves no trail, and the blend is weighted by light so a lone\nglint does not flicker. A jump of the camera starts the history again.\n\nThe wet cobbles' single-pixel sparkle under lamps and flares settles into\na sheen; grass, twigs and wires stop crawling; the grain of the occlusion,\nreflections and flare shafts averages out. A fast pan and a walking\nsoldier show no ghosting. Rain, sparks, tracers, flashes and flames would\nsmear through it, so they are drawn after it (the late pass of effects.js;\nthe rain hides behind the scene by its depth, weather.js). High and medium\n(with the effects chain); about 0.3 ms at 1024x768 on an M1 Max.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -3","description":"Commit the temporal anti-aliasing"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":702,"cache_read_input_tokens":821603,"output_tokens":1078,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":702,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1078,"cache_read_input_tokens":821603,"cache_creation_input_tokens":702,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":702},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01NxiZLodf5rCFsV1y6sUjAv":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git status --short && git add fun/hedgerow/js/taa.js fun/hedgerow/js/effects.js fun/hedgerow/js/weather.js fun/hedgerow/js/main.js fun/hedgerow/README.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nHedgerow graphics: temporal anti-aliasing\n\nEvery frame the projection is shifted by a sub-pixel step (eight steps of\na Halton sequence, around the render in main.js), and a pass after the\nlight in the rain (taa.js) blends each frame into the history of the ones\nbefore: where a pixel was last frame comes from the scene depth seen with\nlast frame's camera (the rifle and the hands, nearer than 1.2 m, move with\nthe camera and are not reprojected); the history is held to a box round\nthe mean of the pixel's 3x3 neighbourhood this frame (luma/chroma), so\nwhat moved leaves no trail, and the blend is weighted by light so a lone\nglint does not flicker. A jump of the camera starts the history again.\n\nThe wet cobbles' single-pixel sparkle under lamps and flares settles into\na sheen; grass, twigs and wires stop crawling; the grain of the occlusion,\nreflections and flare shafts averages out. A fast pan and a walking\nsoldier show no ghosting. Rain, sparks, tracers, flashes and flames would\nsmear through it, so they are drawn after it (the late pass of effects.js;\nthe rain hides behind the scene by its depth, weather.js). High and medium\n(with the effects chain); about 0.3 ms at 1024x768 on an M1 Max.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -3","description":"Commit the temporal anti-aliasing"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"741f9d26-bce5-41b8-92c9-810a1497502c","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011CgFYSzUEDgcRTQhrb5Ahf","requestRef":"0092503a-1da1-457a-9f90-d334c2a203d2","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"5e7c88be-74f5-4b7f-ad40-a5a72767106d","timestamp":"2026-10-21T14:30:46.437Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"hedgerow-poc","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
